{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just been thrown in prison for a long time and you have only one option: escape. After spending days pacing around your cell, you spot the entrance to a secret room... surely the work of a former inmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to dig day and night to make your way to the exit and hope to regain your freedom. But be careful, the undergrounds of this prison are full of dangers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/bc3a0bfa5d5ba2fc0451affbc4a0824a.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig freely and shape the underground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is procedurally generated, offering a unique adventure that can be replayed endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A open world survival craft with unique rogue-lite mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, collect, and build a base that reflects your own style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/9ef5ffab1c864e0089d4139185648215.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground of this prison are full of mysteries. You might come across ancient abandoned ruins, secret prison quarters, or even natural caves. Be careful of the many dangers that lurk there, but keep your eyes open\u2014these places are full of resources that will help you complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/7d09ce966af459679a097d7891853940.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you have discovered to create a makeshift camp and take advantage of this opportunity to upgrade your equipment before continuing on your journey into the depths.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/e7e194ed324baf491725d6deb5e94b87.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine magic and advanced detection methods to find the exit. But be careful, sometimes the exit does not mean the end of the adventure...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045500?t=1759834883","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4045500?t=1759834883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/9c703ef9d17f0fb844bed5aed73705871d1c80bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759834883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/9c703ef9d17f0fb844bed5aed73705871d1c80bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759834883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've just been thrown in prison for a long time and you have only one option: escape. After spending days pacing around your cell, you spot the entrance to a secret room... surely the work of a former inmate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to dig day and night to make your way to the exit and hope to regain your freedom. But be careful, the undergrounds of this prison are full of dangers...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/bc3a0bfa5d5ba2fc0451affbc4a0824a.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig freely and shape the underground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground world is procedurally generated, offering a unique adventure that can be replayed endlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A open world survival craft with unique rogue-lite mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dig, collect, and build a base that reflects your own style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/9ef5ffab1c864e0089d4139185648215.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground of this prison are full of mysteries. You might come across ancient abandoned ruins, secret prison quarters, or even natural caves. Be careful of the many dangers that lurk there, but keep your eyes open\u2014these places are full of resources that will help you complete your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045500/extras/7d09ce966af459679a097d7891853940.webp?t=1759834883\" width=600 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the resources you have discovered to create a makeshift camp and take advantage of this opportunity to upgrade your equipment before cont